SUMMARY:November ART Crawl: Tour 3 top private galleries/spaces ($10 per p
 erson)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nWe will continue with our monthly **Ar
 t Crawls**!\n\n***Please read everything over first.***\n\n\\*\\*\\*Novemb
 er Art Crawl = Saturday November 7th (1pm-3pm)\n\n16 people/members each t
 ime.\n\n**$10 per person.**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Sent via e-transfer when you sig
 nup/rsvp.**\n\n**I'm not able to HOLD space for you.**\n\n***--We will vis
 it 3 different*** (downtown/west end/east end) galleries each month **(wit
 h short walks between each one)**\nEach month will be different galleries 
 and/or artist-run centres.\n\n\\*\\*We'll meet the Gallery owners/artists/
 directors--who will lead us in tours and conversation at each stop.\n\nNO 
 weather cancellations---**we will carry on!**\n\nNO cancellations/no refun
 ds or any [re-scheduling](http://re-scheduling...if/) if you cannot make i
 t.\n\n\\-\\-\\-Check your calendars and PLAN ahead if you can join us\\-\\
 -and please arrive on time\\. We're not able to wait for you\\. Sorry\\.\n
 \nAre you Interested in ART/artists--**and learning/visiting the exception
 al local galleries we have in Toronto? With other MEETUP members.**\n\nSat
 urday November 7th ***(1pm-3pm)***\n\nOnce I have 16 **confirmations** fro
 m Meetup members (you)--I will email you the start location of our Novembe
 r ART Crawl!! Next week.\n\n**Our first stop**. Bloor/Symington (we then h
 ead SOUTH)\n\nIf interested\, please email me $10.\n\nInclude your first n
 ame only\, and email address for a reply.\n\n**I will then confirm you.**\
 n\nAnd will firm up our itinerary with you in a few days.\n\nSee you on Sa
 turday November 7th--if you're confirmed--watch for an email directly from
  me!!\n\n***We will do this again in November (I hope)*** and ongoing all 
 Winter---as we find some interesting spaces and exhibitions.\n\nEach month
  will be posted separately.\n\nYou can email me directly here:\n\n**toront
 oisculture@gmail.com**\n\nGreg\n\nThanks\n\n(Please understand I have NO s
 pace for any guests you may wish to bring with you. I am limited in group 
 size based on the GALLERY instructions)
